{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0043_1000_028ari", "source_sha256": "77530999077d77af52224e7d31478e6ff2c11aa03f985bd23a5d68965acbf1ef", "ja": "い、今のうちに……そーっとなら……！", "zh": "趁、趁现在……小心别被发现的话……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0043_1001_p", "source_sha256": "abc27c8c0768837e1be6763160524a997488796165ef8a4aa80cce3e4214df0e", "ja": "亜利沙、なにをしてるんだ？", "zh": "亚利沙，你在做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0043_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "d42a5a4a50fa9929fa2d63115afc39a663d7d9a7bd7945d8764ab68252b018d5", "ja": "ひゃあ！！？　{$P$}さん！？", "zh": "呀啊！！？{$P$}先生！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0043_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "62b6742f1049f33d1054a3be90e61bfdafaf920ae24ff00d298564b5b621e26d", "ja": "ち、違うんです！　ありさ、桃子ちゃんや春香さんを\n客席からコールしようなんて、そんなコトは……っ！", "zh": "不、不是的！亚利沙绝对不是想从观众席\n帮桃子和春香喊Call，绝对不是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0043_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4cbcec3b2d5ace036cbff701665e8d91f436158b83a16a303cf82f8ca5b1a818", "ja": "ほう。", "zh": "哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0043_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "5dc29d4e33d6fba0aa39b577fb02896f52d3c31875cd1f3ca94275239722da71", "ja": "あとあと、正面から写真も何枚か……って、\nありさ、誘導尋問されてませんか！？", "zh": "还有还有，也不是想从正面拍上几张照片……呃，\n亚利沙是不是被套话了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0043_1006_p", "source_sha256": "eed23495763faaaa89126bd9f60d2d5fc19ad6bd767e739cf9c00e24589c8c71", "ja": "全くした覚えはないけど、全部吐いたみたいだな！\nそういう事なら……ほら、急がないと。", "zh": "我不记得自己有套你话，但你好像全都招了！\n既然是这样……来，动作快。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0043_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "8a2e931a9a845f61c29b71322ce1e5c988adf6ae242a109a924df3bb77152d65", "ja": "えええっ！？　い、行って、いいんですか！？", "zh": "咦咦咦！？亚、亚利沙，真的可以去吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0043_1008_p", "source_sha256": "5089da3470f1acf8cce8c34cfbcd5bf782af5690673a1f0e4d7bd0b876b08d2a", "ja": "アイドルが大好きなところは、亜利沙の大切な\n魅力のひとつだからな。盛り上がってくるといい。", "zh": "对偶像的热爱，也是亚利沙的重要魅力之一。\n你就去好好炒热气氛吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0043_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b2b081e421cc7cc8d61d352c8fa907845d1a94a814fbbcd43e9e62ca25ab58ef", "ja": "あ、でもお客さんに見つかると困るから、\n機材のところでな！", "zh": "啊，但要是被观众发现就麻烦了，\n所以只能跑到器材那里喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0043_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "47dc670336df0b801fc41216893c83c4cff5c5ce45a72edf7a6d2587ceb6875d", "ja": "{$P$}さん……！\nううっ、ありがとうございます～～～っ！！！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……！\n呜呜，太感谢你了～～～！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0043_1011_p", "source_sha256": "781b934cc67141473ea38f8ed78e4cc032e2fa4cafaef2d071c7024ee16a30da", "ja": "でも写真くらい、ステージで撮ればいいんじゃないか？\nMCの最中とかなら、桃子も怒らないと思うけど。", "zh": "不过拍照这种小事，在舞台上拍不就好了吗？\n如果是选正在主持的时候，我想桃子应该也不会生气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0043_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "bfbc439d5b15e73f39f32edd5c9f6cedcc02be3fbd0980c1a5bc2e32f3c01ad8", "ja": "ふぇっ！！？\nそ、そんな素晴らしいコト、やっていいんですか！？", "zh": "咦！！？\n这、这么棒的事情，亚利沙真的可以做吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0043_1013_p", "source_sha256": "4268f391ab8487edc96de6ae233801cbc89703674c19ccd8fb8d280976a9c12b", "ja": "ああ、面白いんじゃないか？　アイドルが撮る\nアイドルの写真……いけるかもしれないな！", "zh": "嗯，这样很有意思不是吗？\n由偶像亲手拍的偶像照片……说不定会大受好评呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0043_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "2e3a240450165ee185855b697317b5ac9f2f0936993cb3dab41df138a65d8c02", "ja": "そ、そういうコトでしたら、お任せください！\nありさ、全力で激写してきます！", "zh": "如、如果是这样，那就交给亚利沙吧！\n亚利沙会全力拍出奇迹美照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0043_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "84744517b761e813290752cbea283c3581e7b747df7cb7bae59935c267b20769", "ja": "あっ、ふたりがMCに……チャンスです！　それじゃあ\n{$P$}さん、ありさ、行ってきます！", "zh": "啊，她们两位要开始主持了……机会来了！\n那么，{$P$}先生，亚利沙出发了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
